        "Name": "Commando",
        "Details": "This version of the Commando sports two autocannons, backed up with a trio of machine guns.  It has a single energy weapon hardpoint to mount a backup weapon of some kind on it's gun arm, in this case with a Breaker autocannon.  The 9JT variant supports a bit more tonnage, but doesn't support rockets or missles.  It has an on-board coolant plant, and a sensor array package that lets it detect enemies from farther away and obnoxiously find and sneak up on them, coming close enough to deal pain and defeat smaller battlemechs.",
